ent but had no business background. Your AI created a near-perfect presentation in minutes."},{name:"Sumer Pandey",quote:"Your product is clearly extremely good with the research part. I got data about the startup that I didn’t even know existed, so that part is pretty impressive. The design and the animations are also great, and I found the overall product a really helpful, useful and dynamic tool."},{name:"Chris Greenham",quote:"I thought your product was very good at creating a presentation based on my prompt and short brief of a technical topic ‘ITIL for Cloud’. The subject content generated for the scenarios was particularly interesting in how it was structured and the layout with use of animation was particularly surprising. Overall a great AI tool to help me in my work a great game changer. Well done to you and your team."},{name:"Thembinkosi Sibeko",quote:"The platform has been interesting to say the least, normally after drafting long documents, I struggle to summarize them or let alone prepare presentations. I found the platform surprisingly intuitive, and straight to the point, and because I know the full length of the points summarized from my document, I was already able to share the draft presentation with my team. The quality of the presentation is what we needed for our first client presentation."}];(0,i.useEffect)(function(){var e=new URLSearchParams(window.location.hash.split("?")[1]).get("docId"),t=new URLSearchParams(window.location.hash.split("?")[1]).get("orderId"),n=new URLSearchParams(window.location.hash.split("?")[1]).get("docName"),r=new URLSearchParams(window.location.hash.split("?")[1]).get("slideCount");ie(n),ce(e),pe(t),ve(r)},[]),(0,i.useEffect)(function(){if(U&&null!==p){var e=!1;"In your brand’s style"==K&&(e=!0),Me(e)}},[C,K]);var Oe=function(){k(!1),E(!1),G(null),Z.controller&&Z.controller.abort()},Me=function(){var e=arguments.length>0&&void 0!==arguments[0]&&arguments[0];if(U||ae){var t=new FormData,n=ae||U.name;t.append("name",